From: Yimura <24669514+Yimura@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 17:18:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/17] SystemUI: run the fold animation only on a hinge-driven
 foldable

YrrpFoldAnimationStartable was bound on every device, so non-foldables
still observed the setting and the sleep state. FoldAnimationSupport
requires config_unfoldTransitionEnabled, config_unfoldTransitionHingeAngle
and a TYPE_HINGE_ANGLE sensor, matching the Settings check. Elsewhere the
startable registers its dump only, the selector stays Stock, and the dump
reports CONFIG_DISABLED, HINGE_ANGLE_DISABLED or NO_HINGE_SENSOR.
